        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okwemera Asaliya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu omu mwaka ogwa musanju, Yehoyaada Nyakatagara akeegumya, yakora endagaano n'engabwa ez'amahe ezaalemaga, ebikumi, nizo zinu: Azaliya mutabani wa Yehoraamu, Isimairi mutabani wa Yehohanaani, Azaliya mutabani w'Obedi, Maaseya mutabani w'Adaaya, n'Elisafaati mutabani wa Zikuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baarabangana omunsi ya Yuda, baiha Abaleevi omu mbuga zoona ez'ensi egi, n'abakuru b'amaju aga baisenkuru Isirairi, kandi baagenda Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 7:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitebe kyona, kyakora endagaano hamu n'omukama, omunju ya Ruhanga. Yehoyaada yagambira abantu ati, “Onu nuwe omwana w'omukama! Ka ateere engoma, MUKAMA nkooku yakigambireho batabani ba Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinu nikyo mukolege: Kimu kya kasatu ky'abamu hali inywe banyakatagara n'Abaleevi abaruga ha mulimo ha Sabbato, kirindege amalembo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kimu kya kasatu, kibege ha nju y'omukama, kimu kya kasatu kibege ha irembo ery'omusingi; kandi abantu boona, babege omuzigati ez'Enju ya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hatalibaho omuntu n'omu ataaha Enju ya MUKAMA, okwihaho banyakatagara n'Abaleevi abarukuheereza, abo nibaikirizibwa kutaaha, habwokuba nibeera, baitu abandi boona, bakwate ekiragiro kya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaleevi beehingulirizege omukama, buli omu akwasire eby'okurwanisa bye; wena araataahaga enju, ogu aitwege. Hoona omukama h'arakaijaga rundi h'arakagendaga, mugendege na uwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaleevi n'Abayuda boona, baakora byona Yehoyaada nyakatagara ebi yabaragiire. Buli omu yaleeta abantu be, abakaba bali b'okwimuka ha mulimo ha Sabbato, n'ab'okugugarukaho; habwokuba Yehoyaada nyakatagara, ab'ebihanda atabarage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaha engabwa amacumu, engabu enkooto n'entoito, ebikaba biri by'omukama Daudi, ebikaba byahwiirwe omunju ya Ruhanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yataho abantu boona balinde omukama, buli muntu akwasire ekyokurwanisa, okuruga ha rubaju orw'obulyo obw'enju, okugarukira ha rw'obumoso, okwehinguliriza itambiro n'Enju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma yaturukya omwana w'omukama, yamujweka ekondo, yamukwasa ekopi ey'Ebiragiro eby'obukama; abantu baamumanya nkooku ali mukama; Yehoyaada n'abatabani baamuseesaho amagita, baagamba bati: “Hangiriza Nzaire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asaliya obu yahuliire etoko y'abantu abarukwiruka nibahaisaniza omukama, yataaha omunju y'Omukama yabahikaho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obu yanagire eriiso, yarora omukama ayemeriire haihi n'enyomyo eya ha mulyango ayehingulirizibwe engabwa z'amahe abarukuteera amakondere abantu ab'ensi egi yoona baijwire omuhimbo nibateera amakondere, abazini nabo nuho bataire, bakwasire ebintu byabo eby'okuzinisa, nibeebembera omutooro ogu ogw'okuhaisaniza, yatemura ebyokujwara bye, yayamuza ati, “Mawe, obugobya! Obugobya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyaada nyakatagara, nubwo yaturukize engabwa ezikaba zitairweho kulinda ihe, yabagambira ati, “Mumurabye omu nkarra z'abalinzi abo mumuturukye aheeru; kandi wena ow'araamukurata, ogu mumukwasizeemu empirima.” Habwokuba akateekereza kandi yagamba ati, “Mutamwitira omunju ya MUKAMA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo kumugwera; obu baamuhikize ha mulyango ogw'irembo ly'embaraasi erya karuziika aho nuho baamunagire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoyaada ebi yakiraanwire",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyaada yakora endagaano n'abantu boona, n'omukama, erukugumya nkooku baraabaga bantu ba MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu boona nubwo baagenzire ha nju ya Baali baagiseesa; amatambiro ge n'ebisisani bye baabicwacwana, nyakatagara we Mataani, baamwitira omumaiso g'amatambiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoyaada, akataho abalinzi ab'okulindaga Enju ya Ruhanga, nibahaburwa banyakatagara Abaleevi, n'Abaleevi abandi, Daudi aba akaba ataireho kurolerraga Enju ya MUKAMA, kumuhongeraga ebihongwa eby'okwokya nibasemererwa kandi nibazina. Daudi nkooku yateekaniize, nkooku kyahandiikirwe omu Biragiro bya Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yata abalinzi ha malembo g'Enju ya MUKAMA, omuntu wena atasemiire omu mulingo gwona, nukwo aleke kugitaaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakwata engabwa, abantu ab'ekitiinisa, abalemi abakuru ab'abantu boona ab'ensi egi, baiha omukama omunju ya MUKAMA, baamuleeta nibamurabya omu irembo ery'eruguru, erirukutwara omu kaaruziika y'omukama; bamuta ha kitebe ky'obukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu boona ab'ensi egi baakyanganuka muno; Asaliya obu yamazire kwitwa n'empirima, orubuga rwatekaana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
